{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01B57F4KxMawce2vS4YX3wDH","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 'Claim 1（GRPO universal failure）是论文最强贡献——unpruned reward 0→0.661而accuracy\n2\t  0pp变化已确认， 所有pruned配置叠加training collapse。Claim 2（collapse severity gradient）在主模型成立（RASP\n3\t  step~10 << Standard step~60）， 但Qwen-Math-7B跨模型证据中RASP与Standard collapse步数重叠，需从\"clean\n4\t  diagnostic\"弱化为\"diagnostic tendency\"。 Claim 3（Redundancy-Stability Tradeoff）从fundamental\n5\t  principle降级为\"empirical observation on DeepSeek-R1 family\"—— 25% SFT gap仅3-5pp（p~0.09），跨模型方向一致但分离度不够。论文仍可投EMNLP\n6\t  Main，但Discussion需诚实承认 generalization limitation。Unstructured pruning baseline（plan_017）是关键补充——structured\n7\t  pruning导致collapse而 unstructured不会，这直接支持structural damage hypothesis并回应Self-Healing\n8\t  comparison。\n9\t\n10\t  '\n11\timagined_experiments:\n12\t- name: Post-prune baselines N=1319 (20%)\n13\t  plan_id: plan_001\n14\t  description: 将post-prune评估从N=100扩展到N=1319，获得±2.4pp CI用于论文Table 1\n15\t  expected_results:\n16\t    unpruned_original_accuracy: 0.854\n17\t    unpruned_original_correct: 1127\n18\t    unpruned_original_n: 1319\n19\t    unpruned_original_stderr: 0.0097\n20\t    rasp_20_postprune_accuracy: 0.298\n21\t    rasp_20_postprune_correct: 393\n22\t    rasp_20_postprune_stderr: 0.0126\n23\t    rasp_20_eos_rate: 0.89\n24\t    rasp_20_avg_len: 782\n25\t    standard_20_postprune_accuracy: 0.261\n26\t    standard_20_postprune_correct: 344\n27\t    standard_20_postprune_stderr: 0.0121\n28\t    standard_20_eos_rate: 0.82\n29\t    standard_20_avg_len: 1145\n30\t    rasp_vs_standard_gap_pp: 3.7\n31\t    rasp_vs_standard_p_value: 0.034\n32\t  result_rationale: 'N=100数据（RASP 31%, Standard 27%）的点估计在扩展到N=1319后预计小幅回落—— N=100的CI为±9pp，真值可能偏低。CI从±9pp收窄到±2.5pp后，3.7pp\n33\t    gap在post-prune阶段 达到弱显著（p=0.034），但这不是论文核心贡献。原始模型85.4%作为pruning damage的参照锚点。 Post-prune\n34\t    EOS率差异（RASP 89% vs Standard 82%）反映Standard对generation流畅性的更大破坏。\n35\t\n36\t    '\n37\t  tables:\n38\t  - 'Table 1: Post-prune accuracy across methods — RASP 29.8% vs Standard 26.1% vs\n39\t    Unpruned 85.4%'\n40\t  figures_description:\n41\t  - 'Fig 2 bar chart第一组: Post-prune accuracy对比，三种方法+unpruned baseline'\n42\t  analysis: 'Post-prune gap（3.7pp）在N=1319下弱显著，确认RASP的CKA-aware selection保留了slightly\n43\t    more functional capacity。但核心意义不在此——pruning后两者都丧失70%+能力，关键在recovery差异。\n44\t\n45\t    '\n46\t- name: All recovered models full eval N=1319\n47\t  plan_id: plan_004\n48\t  description: 整合所有recovery路径的N=1319评估，构建论文核心Table 2\n49\t  expected_results:\n50\t    rasp_sft_accuracy: 0.6149\n51\t    rasp_sft_correct: 811\n52\t    standard_sft_accuracy: 0.5929\n53\t    standard_sft_correct: 782\n54\t    sft_gap_pp: 2.2\n55\t    sft_gap_p_value: 0.25\n56\t    rasp_grpo_step5_accuracy: 0.6065\n57\t    rasp_grpo_step5_correct: 800\n58\t    standard_grpo_step50_accuracy: 0.5891\n59\t    standard_grpo_step50_correct: 777\n60\t    unpruned_sft_accuracy: 0.8127\n61\t    unpruned_grpo_step100_accuracy: 0.8127\n62\t    unpruned_grpo_step100_correct: 1072\n63\t    unpruned_grpo_delta_pp: 0.0\n64\t    grpo_delta_rasp_pp: -0.84\n65\t    grpo_delta_standard_pp: -0.38\n66\t    grasp_sft_accuracy_n1319: 0.395\n67\t    grasp_sft_correct_n1319: 521\n68\t    grasp_grpo_accuracy_n1319: 0.388\n69\t  result_rationale: '已有数据已完整确认核心pattern: unpruned GRPO accuracy=SFT accuracy（1072/1319完全相同），\n70\t    RASP和Standard GRPO均不优于SFT（甚至微降）。GRASPrune post-SFT从N=100的41%在N=1319 预计轻微下降至~39.5%（N=100\n71\t    CI较宽）。GRASPrune post-GRPO预计~38.8%，同样无法从GRPO获益。 所有recovery路径都确认Claim 1: GRPO reward-accuracy\n72\t    decoupling is universal。\n73\t\n74\t    '\n75\t  tables:\n76\t  - 'Table 2: Recovery accuracy matrix — rows=method (RASP/Standard/GRASPrune/Unpruned),\n77\t    cols=recovery (Post-prune/SFT/GRPO)'\n78\t  figures_description:\n79\t  - 'Fig 2 grouped bar chart: 4 methods × 3 recovery stages，展示pruning damage和recovery\n80\t    trajectory'\n81\t  analysis: '核心发现已confirm: GRPO在所有配置下都不改善accuracy。SFT gap 2.2pp (p=0.25)不显著—— 在median\n82\t    tier下报告为\"consistent trend\"而非\"significant result\"。GRASPrune作为external baseline进一步strengthen\n83\t    Claim 1。\n84\t\n85\t    '\n86\t- name: GRASPrune full pipeline (20%)\n87\t  plan_id: plan_005\n88\t  description: 'GRASPrune (ACL 2026 SOTA) 20%稀疏度完整pipeline: prune→eval→SFT→GRPO'\n89\t  expected_results:\n90\t    postprune_accuracy_n1319: 0.068\n91\t    postprune_correct: 90\n92\t    postprune_eos_rate: 0.03\n93\t    postprune_avg_len: 3950\n94\t    post_sft_accuracy_n1319: 0.395\n95\t    post_sft_correct: 521\n96\t    post_sft_eos_rate: 0.96\n97\t    grpo_collapse_step: 18\n98\t    grpo_peak_reward: 0.012\n99\t    grpo_peak_reward_step: 10\n100\t    grpo_final_frac_zero_std: 0.92\n101\t    grpo_final_grad_norm: 0.008\n102\t    post_grpo_accuracy_n1319: 0.388\n103\t    post_grpo_delta_vs_sft_pp: -0.7\n104\t  result_rationale: 'GRASPrune的gate-based importance scoring造成最大structural damage（post-prune\n105\t    7%）， 因为gate training优化output preservation但不考虑结构冗余——它aggressive地同时移除了 important和redundant\n106\t    structures。SFT恢复到39.5%但远低于RASP(61.5%)/Standard(59.3%)， 因为deeper structural damage限制了SFT的function\n107\t    redistribution能力。 GRPO collapse在step~18，介于RASP(10)和Standard(60)之间——GRASPrune的gate\n108\t    training 意外保留了部分redundant结构（它们恰好有低gradient importance），所以比RASP慢collapse， 但远不如Standard，因为整体structural\n109\t    capacity太低（39.5% SFT baseline）。 Peak reward仅0.012（vs RASP 0.039, Standard 0.065），确认reward\n110\t    signal与starting accuracy相关。\n111\t\n112\t    '\n113\t  tables:\n114\t  - 'Table 2 新增行: GRASPrune — 6.8% / 39.5% / 38.8%'\n115\t  - 'Table 3 新增行: GRASPrune collapse step ~18, peak reward 0.012'\n116\t  figures_description:\n117\t  - 'Fig 1 新增曲线: GRASPrune GRPO training dynamics (reward, frac_zero_std vs step)'\n118\t  - 'Fig 2 新增组: GRASPrune recovery trajectory bar'\n119\t  analysis: 'GRASPrune作为ACL 2026 SOTA external baseline强化了论文的generality: 即使最先进的 structured\n120\t    pruning method也无法避免GRPO collapse。其collapse timing(step 18)处于 RASP(10)和Standard(60)之间，为Claim\n121\t    2的severity gradient增加了第四个data point， 支持collapse速度与structural damage类型的关联性。\n122\t\n123\t    '\n124\t- name: Multi-seed post-prune eval (5 seeds)\n125\t  plan_id: plan_006\n126\t  description: 5个随机种子的post-prune评估，建立RASP vs Standard variance estimation\n127\t  expected_results:\n128\t    rasp_20_mean_accuracy: 0.304\n129\t    rasp_20_std: 0.028\n130\t    rasp_20_seed_results:\n131\t    - 0.31\n132\t    - 0.28\n133\t    - 0.33\n134\t    - 0.29\n135\t    - 0.31\n136\t    standard_20_mean_accuracy: 0.265\n137\t    standard_20_std: 0.032\n138\t    standard_20_seed_results:\n139\t    - 0.27\n140\t    - 0.24\n141\t    - 0.3\n142\t    - 0.22\n143\t    - 0.29\n144\t    pairwise_gap_mean_pp: 3.9\n145\t    pairwise_gap_std: 2.1\n146\t    paired_t_test_p: 0.024\n147\t    cohen_d: 0.58\n148\t    seeds_used:\n149\t    - 42\n150\t    - 123\n151\t    - 456\n152\t    - 789\n153\t    - 1024\n154\t  result_rationale: 'Structured pruning对calibration data敏感——calibration batch的随机性影响哪些structures\n155\t    被选中pruning。5个种子下RASP的variance（σ=2.8pp）略低于Standard（σ=3.2pp），因为 CKA-aware scoring提供了额外的稳定性信号（redundancy\n156\t    estimation跨seeds更一致）。 Paired t-test p=0.024达到显著，因为paired design消除了seed-level共变量。\n157\t    但Cohen''s d=0.58属于中等效应量，不足以称为\"strong advantage\"。\n158\t\n159\t    '\n160\t  tables:\n161\t  - 'Table 1 supplement: Mean±std post-prune accuracy across 5 seeds'\n162\t  figures_description:\n163\t  - 'Appendix box plot: 5-seed post-prune accuracy distribution, RASP vs Standard'\n164\t  analysis: '5-seed paired test达到显著（p=0.024），但效应量中等（d=0.58）。在median tier下 这支持\"RASP\n165\t    provides a consistent small advantage in structure selection\"， 但不足以成为论文主要卖点——核心贡献仍是GRPO\n166\t    collapse phenomenon。\n167\t\n168\t    '\n169\t- name: Scoring ablation (magnitude/gradient/random)\n170\t  plan_id: plan_007\n171\t  description: 20%稀疏度下magnitude-only、gradient-only、random pruning scoring对比\n172\t  expected_results:\n173\t    magnitude_only_accuracy: 0.24\n174\t    magnitude_only_eos_rate: 0.78\n175\t    gradient_only_accuracy: 0.28\n176\t    gradient_only_eos_rate: 0.85\n177\t    random_accuracy: 0.17\n178\t    random_eos_rate: 0.45\n179\t    random_avg_len: 2680\n180\t    rasp_ref: 0.31\n181\t    standard_ref: 0.27\n182\t    ordering: RASP(31%) > gradient(28%) ≈ Standard(27%) > magnitude(24%) > random(17%)\n183\t    cka_marginal_contribution_pp: 3.0\n184\t  result_rationale: 'Standard ≈ importance(gradient×magnitude)，所以gradient-only(28%)接近Standard(27%)——\n185\t    magnitude信息对gradient已有的信号增量很小。Magnitude-only(24%)丢失了gradient的 task-specific信号，退化到只看权重大小。Random(17%)是下界——无信息选择。\n186\t    RASP(31%)相对gradient-only(28%)的3pp增量就是CKA(functional redundancy)的marginal contribution。这3pp很小但方向一致，说明CKA提供了互补但non-dominant的信号。\n187\t\n188\t    '\n189\t  tables:\n190\t  - 'Table 6: Scoring ablation — Random(17%) < Magnitude(24%) < Gradient(28%) ≈ Standard(27%)\n191\t    < RASP(31%)'\n192\t  figures_description:\n193\t  - 'Fig 3 ablation bar chart: 5种scoring方法的post-prune accuracy对比'\n194\t  analysis: 'CKA的marginal contribution仅3pp，说明在post-prune阶段CKA是helpful but not decisive的\n195\t    补充信号。核心pruning quality仍由gradient/importance决定。CKA的关键价值在GRPO collapse differential（Claim\n196\t    2）而非post-prune accuracy（Claim 3的弱化体现）。\n197\t\n198\t    '\n199\t- name: CKA-recoverability correlation analysis\n200\t  plan_id: plan_008\n201\t  description: Per-head F(h) vs post-recovery activation change的mixed-effects regression\n202\t  expected_results:\n203\t    overall_pearson_r: 0.38\n204\t    overall_p_value: 0.003\n205\t    within_layer_r: 0.22\n206\t    within_layer_p: 0.041\n207\t    between_layer_variance_explained: 0.62\n208\t    within_layer_variance_explained: 0.08\n209\t    mixed_effects_fixed_slope: 0.31\n210\t    mixed_effects_random_intercept_sd: 0.18\n211\t    layer_icc: 0.71\n212\t    control_weight_norm_partial_r: 0.12\n213\t    control_grad_importance_partial_r: 0.15\n214\t    n_heads_analyzed: 224\n215\t  result_rationale: 'F(h)（CKA-based functional redundancy score）在层间水平与recovery后activation\n216\t    change 显著相关（r=0.38），因为不同层的redundancy基线差异大——早期层功能高度冗余，深层更specialized。 但within-layer的预测力弱（r=0.22），因为同层内heads的redundancy差异小，\n217\t    局部connectivity和positional encoding效应主导了recovery dynamics。 Layer ICC=0.71意味着71%的variance在层间，仅29%在层内。这解释了为什么CKA-aware\n218\t    pruning （RASP）在post-prune阶段只提供marginal advantage——大部分可利用的信号在层级选择， 而RASP和Standard在层级分配上差异不大（都优先剪浅层MLP）。\n219\t\n220\t    '\n221\t  tables:\n222\t  - 'Table 9 (Appendix): Mixed-effects regression coefficients'\n223\t  figures_description:\n224\t  - 'Fig 4: Scatter plot of F(h) vs ΔActivation, colored by layer depth, with regression\n225\t    line'\n226\t  - 'Appendix: ICC by layer bar chart'\n227\t  analysis: 'CKA作为recoverability predictor在macro level有效但micro level较弱。 这直接支持Claim\n228\t    3的弱化版本——CKA captures a real signal（r=0.38, p=0.003）， 但不足以成为\"fundamental principle\"级别的predictor。报告为\"CKA\n229\t    identifies a meaningful but layer-dominated redundancy signal\"。\n230\t\n231\t    '\n232\t- name: SFT-only recovery comparison\n233\t  plan_id: plan_009\n234\t  description: RASP vs Standard在SFT-only recovery下的对比（无GRPO）\n235\t  expected_results:\n236\t    rasp_sft_20_accuracy: 0.6149\n237\t    standard_sft_20_accuracy: 0.5929\n238\t    sft_gap_20_pp: 2.2\n239\t    sft_gap_20_p_value: 0.25\n240\t    rasp_sft_20_loss_final: 0.64\n241\t    standard_sft_20_loss_final: 0.64\n242\t    rasp_sft_20_token_acc: 0.83\n243\t    standard_sft_20_token_acc: 0.83\n244\t    learning_curve_crossover_step: null\n245\t    convergence_step_rasp: 1400\n246\t    convergence_step_standard: 1350\n247\t  result_rationale: 'SFT-only数据已有（RASP 61.49%, Standard 59.29%, gap 2.2pp, p=0.25）。\n248\t    两者训练dynamics几乎完全相同——final loss 0.64, token accuracy 83%——表明 SFT的teacher-forcing机制能equally\n249\t    well地利用不同pruning scheme保留的结构。 CKA-aware pruning在SFT recovery中的advantage是marginal的：SFT通过梯度下降\n250\t    重新分配功能到remaining structures，不太依赖原始redundancy patterns。 Gap方向一致（RASP > Standard）但magnitude不足以达到significance\n251\t    at N=1319。\n252\t\n253\t    '\n254\t  tables:\n255\t  - 'Table 2 SFT-only列: RASP 61.5% vs Standard 59.3% (p=0.25)'\n256\t  figures_description:\n257\t  - 'Appendix: SFT training loss curves对比 (RASP vs Standard, nearly identical)'\n258\t  analysis: 'SFT-only comparison确认Claim 3的一半：SFT recovery下RASP advantage是marginal。\n259\t    与GRPO collapse的dramatic差异形成对比——optimal pruning确实depends on recovery paradigm，\n260\t    但SFT方向的evidence弱于GRPO方向。\n261\t\n262\t    '\n263\t- name: 25% sparsity full pipeline\n264\t  plan_id: plan_010\n265\t  description: 25%稀疏度RASP+Standard完整pipeline (prune→SFT→GRPO)，验证sparsity scaling\n266\t  expected_results:\n267\t    postprune_rasp_25: 0.21\n268\t    postprune_standard_25: 0.16\n269\t    sft_rasp_25_accuracy: 0.5449\n270\t    sft_rasp_25_correct: 719\n271\t    sft_rasp_25_stderr: 0.0137\n272\t    sft_standard_25_accuracy: 0.5125\n273\t    sft_standard_25_correct: 676\n274\t    sft_gap_25_pp: 3.24\n275\t    sft_gap_25_p_value: 0.089\n276\t    grpo_rasp_25_collapse_step: 7\n277\t    grpo_rasp_25_peak_reward: 0.018\n278\t    grpo_rasp_25_peak_frac_zero_std: 0.97\n279\t    grpo_rasp_25_final_grad_norm: 0.005\n280\t    grpo_standard_25_collapse_step: 30\n281\t    grpo_standard_25_peak_reward: 0.042\n282\t    grpo_standard_25_step30_frac_zero_std: 0.72\n283\t    grpo_standard_25_transient_recovery: false\n284\t    grpo_standard_25_final_reward: 0.028\n285\t    post_grpo_rasp_25_accuracy: 0.535\n286\t    post_grpo_standard_25_accuracy: 0.505\n287\t    collapse_ratio_rasp_vs_standard: 4.3\n288\t  result_rationale: '25%稀疏度放大所有效应： (1) SFT gap从2.2pp扩大到3.24pp（p=0.089）——更多结构移除使RASP的CKA-aware\n289\t    selection 产生更大differential effect，但p仍在[0.05,0.15]范围内，属于marginal。 (2) GRPO collapse加速——RASP从step~10降到step~7，Standard从step~60降到step~30。\n290\t    两者都因更少structural capacity而更快collapse。但ratio从6x(20%)降到4.3x(25%)， 因为Standard在25%下也开始失去redundancy，两者向同一个floor\n291\t    convergence。 (3) Standard在25%下不再有transient recovery（20%时step~60 dip后recovered\n292\t    to step~90）—— 25%的structural capacity不足以支持recovery。 这是median tier的核心: collapse\n293\t    gradient存在但\"不如20%那么干净\"。\n294\t\n295\t    '\n296\t  tables:\n297\t  - 'Table 1 新增25%行: RASP 21%→54.5%→53.5%, Standard 16%→51.3%→50.5%'\n298\t  - 'Table 3 新增25%行: collapse steps and dynamics'\n299\t  figures_description:\n300\t  - 'Fig 1 新增panel: 25% GRPO training dynamics (reward, frac_zero_std curves)'\n301\t  - 'Fig 5: Collapse step vs sparsity level line plot (20% and 25%, RASP vs Standard)'\n302\t  analysis: '25%数据是Claim 2的关键支撑——collapse severity gradient在两个sparsity levels上成立。\n303\t    但ratio compression（6x→4.3x）和Standard失去recovery能力说明gradient在高sparsity下变noisy。 SFT\n304\t    gap 3.24pp（p=0.089）是论文能报告的最强SFT evidence——在median tier下报告为 \"marginally significant\n305\t    trend (p<0.1) that amplifies with sparsity\"。\n306\t\n307\t    '\n308\t- name: 30% sparsity probe (prune + eval only)\n309\t  plan_id: plan_011\n310\t  description: 30%稀疏度RASP+Standard post-prune评估，mapping practical sparsity ceiling\n311\t  expected_results:\n312\t    rasp_30_postprune_accuracy: 0.12\n313\t    rasp_30_postprune_stderr: 0.032\n314\t    rasp_30_eos_rate: 0.38\n315\t    rasp_30_avg_len: 2850\n316\t    standard_30_postprune_accuracy: 0.09\n317\t    standard_30_postprune_stderr: 0.029\n318\t    standard_30_eos_rate: 0.31\n319\t    standard_30_avg_len: 3200\n320\t    gap_pp: 3.0\n321\t    gap_p_value: 0.48\n322\t  result_rationale: '30%稀疏度接近structured pruning的实际上限——从25%(RASP 21%, Standard 16%)到30%，\n323\t    accuracy再降约50%。两者都接近random chance on GSM8K（~10-12%可能仅靠简单算术题得分）。 EOS率极低（RASP 38%,\n324\t    Standard 31%）表明模型generation能力严重受损，大量输出截断。 Gap（3pp）在这个低accuracy下无统计意义（p=0.48），因为variance极大。\n325\t    与D005的35%结果（total collapse）一致——30%是collapse onset，35%是complete failure。\n326\t\n327\t    '\n328\t  tables:\n329\t  - 'Table 1 新增30%行: RASP 12% vs Standard 9% (post-prune only)'\n330\t  figures_description:\n331\t  - 'Fig 5 extended: Sparsity vs post-prune accuracy curve (20%, 25%, 30%), marking\n332\t    practical ceiling'\n333\t  analysis: '确认~25-30%为DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B的structured pruning practical ceiling。\n334\t    不进行recovery实验因为starting point太低（<15%）。Paper discussion中报告为 \"structured pruning\n335\t    beyond 25% is impractical for this model class\"。\n336\t\n337\t    '\n338\t- name: Extended eval (MMLU, HumanEval, MATH-500)\n339\t  plan_id: plan_012\n340\t  description: 最佳recovered config (RASP SFT 20%) + unpruned在三个OOD benchmark上的评估\n341\t  expected_results:\n342\t    rasp_sft_20_math500: 0.318\n343\t    rasp_sft_20_humaneval: 0.354\n344\t    rasp_sft_20_mmlu: 0.512\n345\t    standard_sft_20_math500: 0.298\n346\t    standard_sft_20_humaneval: 0.329\n347\t    standard_sft_20_mmlu: 0.498\n348\t    unpruned_sft_math500: 0.524\n349\t    unpruned_sft_humaneval: 0.549\n350\t    unpruned_sft_mmlu: 0.638\n351\t    unpruned_original_math500: 0.558\n352\t    unpruned_original_humaneval: 0.561\n353\t    unpruned_original_mmlu: 0.651\n354\t    recovery_ratio_gsm8k: 0.757\n355\t    recovery_ratio_math500: 0.607\n356\t    recovery_ratio_humaneval: 0.645\n357\t    recovery_ratio_mmlu: 0.803\n358\t  result_rationale: 'SFT recovery在GSM8K上恢复到75.7%（RASP 61.5% / Unpruned 81.3%），但OOD\n359\t    benchmark 恢复率显著更低：MATH-500仅60.7%，HumanEval 64.5%。这是因为SFT teacher-forcing使用 GSM8K\n360\t    gold solutions，recovery部分是GSM8K-specific pattern重建而非通用reasoning能力恢复。 MMLU恢复率最高(80.3%)因为factual\n361\t    knowledge主要存储在embedding层和attention patterns中， structured pruning主要移除MLP groups（占pruned\n362\t    structures的100%），对factual recall影响较小。 RASP vs Standard gap在OOD上方向一致但magnitude更小（MATH-500:\n363\t    2pp, MMLU: 1.4pp）， 说明CKA-aware selection的advantage部分是GSM8K-specific的。\n364\t\n365\t    '\n366\t  tables:\n367\t  - 'Table 8: Extended eval — accuracy by benchmark and method'\n368\t  figures_description:\n369\t  - 'Fig 6 (Appendix): Recovery ratio by benchmark grouped bar chart'\n370\t  analysis: 'OOD evaluation reveals SFT recovery的domain specificity。核心message: pruned\n371\t    model recovers 75%+ capability on in-domain (GSM8K) but only 60-65% on harder\n372\t    math/code tasks。 这strengthens the argument for better recovery methods——current\n373\t    SFT pipeline有inherent limitation。 对Claim 3补充了nuance: RASP advantage在OOD上diminishes。\n374\t\n375\t    '\n376\t- name: Bonsai baseline (20%)\n377\t  plan_id: plan_013\n378\t  description: Bonsai (ICML 2025, gradient-free) 20%稀疏度作为第三个external baseline\n379\t  expected_results:\n380\t    postprune_accuracy_n100: 0.19\n381\t    postprune_eos_rate: 0.52\n382\t    post_sft_accuracy_n100: 0.47\n383\t    post_sft_eos_rate: 0.95\n384\t    grpo_collapse_step: 28\n385\t    grpo_peak_reward: 0.022\n386\t    grpo_final_frac_zero_std: 0.88\n387\t    post_grpo_accuracy_n100: 0.46\n388\t  result_rationale: 'Bonsai用activation norm作为pruning criterion（gradient-free），post-prune\n389\t    19%介于 random(17%)和Standard(27%)之间——activation norm是importance的粗略proxy但不如gradient准确。\n390\t    SFT恢复到47%，高于GRASPrune(41%)但低于Standard(59%)，因为Bonsai的structure selection 质量介于random和gradient-based之间。\n391\t    GRPO collapse at step~28——比GRASPrune(18)慢因为Bonsai的简单norm-based selection 意外保留了更多redundant\n392\t    structures（redundant structures often have moderate norms）， 但比Standard(60)快因为overall\n393\t    pruning quality更差。\n394\t\n395\t    '\n396\t  tables:\n397\t  - 'Table 2 新增行 (Appendix): Bonsai — 19% / 47% / 46%'\n398\t  - 'Table 3 新增行 (Appendix): Bonsai collapse step ~28'\n399\t  figures_description:\n400\t  - 'Appendix: Bonsai training dynamics curve'\n401\t  analysis: 'Bonsai作为gradient-free baseline补全了pruning method spectrum。四种方法的collapse\n402\t    ordering (RASP 10 < GRASPrune 18 < Bonsai 28 < Standard 60)进一步支持Claim 2: collapse速度\n403\t    与pruning method的redundancy removal aggressive度相关。但Bonsai是P2优先级—— 如果GPU budget紧张可以drop，GRASPrune足以作为external\n404\t    baseline。\n405\t\n406\t    '\n407\t- name: CKA reliability analysis\n408\t  plan_id: plan_014\n409\t  description: Split-half consistency和calibration size sensitivity验证CKA scoring稳定性\n410\t  expected_results:\n411\t    split_half_spearman_rho: 0.93\n412\t    split_half_p_value: 1.0e-45\n413\t    cal_256_spearman_rho: 0.88\n414\t    cal_512_spearman_rho: 0.93\n415\t    cal_1024_spearman_rho: 0.95\n416\t    cal_256_accuracy_delta_vs_512: -0.015\n417\t    cal_1024_accuracy_delta_vs_512: 0.008\n418\t    n_structures_scored: 896\n419\t    scoring_time_256_sec: 180\n420\t    scoring_time_512_sec: 340\n421\t    scoring_time_1024_sec: 660\n422\t  result_rationale: 'CKA是kernel-based similarity metric，理论上convergence rate为O(1/√n)——512\n423\t    samples 已足够达到ρ>0.9。Split-half consistency ρ=0.93表明在random half-split下scoring order\n424\t    高度稳定。256→512的提升（0.88→0.93）是主要增量，512→1024仅marginal（0.93→0.95）， 说明512是cost-effective\n425\t    minimum。 Accuracy delta确认scoring stability translates to pruning outcome stability:\n426\t    cal=256 vs cal=512仅相差1.5pp post-prune accuracy，cal=1024 vs 512仅0.8pp。\n427\t\n428\t    '\n429\t  tables:\n430\t  - 'Table 10 (Appendix): CKA reliability by calibration size'\n431\t  figures_description:\n432\t  - 'Appendix: Spearman ρ vs calibration size curve'\n433\t  analysis: 'CKA scoring在512 samples下已稳定（ρ=0.93），支持RASP的practical usability。 这是一个defensive\n434\t    result——reviewer可能质疑CKA computation的稳定性， 该实验提供conclusive evidence that CKA-based\n435\t    scoring is reliable。\n436\t\n437\t    '\n438\t- name: Alpha sensitivity ablation (full)\n439\t  plan_id: plan_015\n440\t  description: α ∈ {0, 0.25, 0.5, 1, 2} post-prune和post-SFT accuracy sweep\n441\t  expected_results:\n442\t    postprune:\n443\t      alpha_0p0: 0.27\n444\t      alpha_0p25: 0.23\n445\t      alpha_0p5: 0.22\n446\t      alpha_1p0: 0.31\n447\t      alpha_2p0: 0.36\n448\t    post_sft_n1319:\n449\t      alpha_0p0: 0.593\n450\t      alpha_0p25: 0.558\n451\t      alpha_0p5: 0.549\n452\t      alpha_1p0: 0.573\n453\t      alpha_2p0: 0.608\n454\t    post_sft_n100_ref:\n455\t      alpha_0p0: 0.64\n456\t      alpha_0p25: null\n457\t      alpha_0p5: null\n458\t      alpha_1p0: 0.57\n459\t      alpha_2p0: 0.62\n460\t    u_shape_minimum_alpha: 0.5\n461\t    optimal_postprune_alpha: 2.0\n462\t    optimal_postsft_alpha: 2.0\n463\t  result_rationale: 'Post-prune U-shape已由alpha_ablation_sweep确认（α=0.5最低22%, α=2.0最高36%）。\n464\t    Post-SFT结果部分已有（N=100）——在N=1319下预计： α=0.0(=Standard)→59.3%（已确认），α=1.0→57.3%（从N=100的57%微调），α=2.0→60.8%（从N=100的62%微调）。\n465\t    Post-SFT的U-shape被SFT recovery压缩但保留方向——α=2.0在SFT后仍最优，因为它在post-prune 阶段保留了最多functional\n466\t    capacity（36%），给SFT更好的starting point。 α=0.25和α=0.5的post-SFT较低是因为它们在post-prune阶段创造了\"noise\n467\t    injection\"效果—— CKA penalty太小时反而干扰了importance ranking而不是有效补充。\n468\t\n469\t    '\n470\t  tables:\n471\t  - 'Table 4: Alpha ablation — post-prune and post-SFT accuracy across α values'\n472\t  figures_description:\n473\t  - 'Fig 3: U-shape curve, dual y-axis (post-prune and post-SFT accuracy vs α)'\n474\t  analysis: 'Alpha ablation是reviewer flagged的Critical experiment。U-shape confirms\n475\t    α是meaningful parameter， 不是arbitrary choice。最优α=2.0（非default 1.0）→paper应report\n476\t    this transparently并 讨论为什么aggressive CKA penalty有利（推测：更强地保护unique structures在reasoning\n477\t    LLM中更关键）。 Post-SFT U-shape压缩但保留说明CKA contribution survives recovery——与plan_008的CKA-recoverability\n478\t    correlation一致。\n479\t\n480\t    '\n481\t- name: Inference speedup benchmark\n482\t  plan_id: plan_016\n483\t  description: Dense vs 20% RASP-pruned vs 20% Standard-pruned wall-clock latency和throughput\n484\t  expected_results:\n485\t    dense_latency_ms: 142\n486\t    rasp_20_latency_ms: 121\n487\t    standard_20_latency_ms: 120\n488\t    rasp_20_latency_reduction_pct: 14.8\n489\t    standard_20_latency_reduction_pct: 15.5\n490\t    dense_throughput_tok_s: 85\n491\t    rasp_20_throughput_tok_s: 99\n492\t    standard_20_throughput_tok_s: 100\n493\t    rasp_20_throughput_gain_pct: 16.5\n494\t    standard_20_throughput_gain_pct: 17.6\n495\t    batch_size: 1\n496\t    seq_len: 512\n497\t    gpu: A100-80GB\n498\t    n_runs: 50\n499\t    warmup_runs: 10\n500\t  result_rationale: '20% structured pruning移除~19%的parameters（全部是complete MLP groups），理论speedup为19%。\n501\t    实际latency reduction ~15%因为：(1)非MLP compute（attention, LayerNorm, embedding）不变，\n502\t    占总compute的~25%；(2)不同层的pruning不均匀导致GPU utilization不optimal； (3)framework overhead（PyTorch\n503\t    dynamic shapes）。RASP和Standard的speedup几乎相同 因为sparsity level相同——pruning method影响which\n504\t    structures被移除，不影响total removal量。 Standard微略快（0.7pp）可能是随机variation或因为Standard pruned的structures恰好使\n505\t    layer sizes更uniform。\n506\t\n507\t    '\n508\t  tables:\n509\t  - 'Table 7: Inference speedup — latency and throughput comparison'\n510\t  figures_description:\n511\t  - 'Appendix: Latency distribution box plot across 50 runs'\n512\t  analysis: '~15% speedup在20% sparsity下是reasonable但不impressive——structured pruning的practical\n513\t    motivation 需要至少25-30% sparsity才能达到meaningful speedup。但这个experiment是reviewer必问的\n514\t    \"where''s the efficiency gain\"的defensive answer。Paper discussion应note that  structured\n515\t    pruning实际speedup低于parameter reduction ratio。\n516\t\n517\t    '\n518\t- name: Unstructured pruning baseline (20%)\n519\t  plan_id: plan_017\n520\t  description: Magnitude-based unstructured pruning 20%作为Self-Healing fair comparison基线\n521\t  expected_results:\n522\t    postprune_accuracy: 0.682\n523\t    postprune_correct: 900\n524\t    postprune_n: 1319\n525\t    postprune_stderr: 0.0128\n526\t    postprune_eos_rate: 0.98\n527\t    post_sft_accuracy: 0.763\n528\t    post_sft_correct: 1007\n529\t    post_sft_stderr: 0.0117\n530\t    grpo_collapse: false\n531\t    grpo_max_steps: 100\n532\t    grpo_final_reward: 0.548\n533\t    grpo_final_frac_zero_std: 0.32\n534\t    grpo_final_grad_norm: 5.82\n535\t    post_grpo_accuracy: 0.758\n536\t    post_grpo_delta_vs_sft_pp: -0.5\n537\t    grpo_reward_accuracy_decoupling: true\n538\t    structured_vs_unstructured_gap_postprune_pp: 38.4\n539\t    structured_vs_unstructured_gap_postsft_pp: 14.8\n540\t  result_rationale: 'Unstructured pruning at 20%仅零化individual weights而不移除structural\n541\t    units——所有224个attention heads和 784个MLP groups保持intact。Post-prune 68.2%远高于structured的30%(RASP)/27%(Standard)，\n542\t    因为每个结构仍有80%的weights functional，network topology完全保留。 SFT恢复到76.3%——接近unpruned(81.3%)，gap仅5pp，因为结构完整性使SFT只需微调权重而非重建功能。\n543\t    GRPO关键发现：NO COLLAPSE。100步训练stable（frac_zero_std<0.35, grad_norm~5.8）， reward达到0.548（vs\n544\t    unpruned 0.661）。但accuracy仍不改善（76.3→75.8, Δ=-0.5pp）—— reward-accuracy decoupling在unstructured\n545\t    pruned model上也成立（Claim 1 strengthened）， 但没有training collapse。 这直接支持structural\n546\t    damage hypothesis: collapse是structural pruning的specific consequence （移除entire\n547\t    exploration pathways），不是pruning in general的问题。Unstructured pruning 保留了所有structural\n548\t    redundancy，因此GRPO可以stable训练。\n549\t\n550\t    '\n551\t  tables:\n552\t  - 'Table 2 新增行: Unstructured 20% — 68.2% / 76.3% / 75.8%'\n553\t  - 'Table 3 新增行: Unstructured — no collapse, 100 steps stable'\n554\t  figures_description:\n555\t  - 'Fig 1 新增panel: Unstructured GRPO dynamics (stable reward, no frac_zero_std spike)'\n556\t  - 'Fig 7: Structured vs Unstructured comparison — collapse is structural-pruning-specific'\n557\t  analysis: '这是median tier最关键的补充实验。Unstructured pruning确认了两个核心insights: (1) Reward-accuracy\n558\t    decoupling is universal（连unstructured也有reward↑ accuracy=），strengthening Claim\n559\t    1; (2) Training collapse is structural-pruning-specific（unstructured无collapse），confirming\n560\t    the structural damage mechanism。 对Self-Healing comparison: Self-Healing用25% unstructured报告recovery——我们在20%\n561\t    unstructured 也看到无collapse，但accuracy仍不从GRPO获益。Paper可argue: Self-Healing的\"RLVR recovery\"\n562\t    可能只是reward improvement without accuracy gain，需要replication with accuracy evaluation。\n563\t\n564\t    '\n565\t- name: SFT OOD eval (Standard 20%)\n566\t  plan_id: plan_018\n567\t  description: Standard SFT 20% (59.29% GSM8K)在MATH-500和HumanEval上的OOD评估\n568\t  expected_results:\n569\t    standard_sft_20_math500: 0.285\n570\t    standard_sft_20_math500_stderr: 0.02\n571\t    standard_sft_20_humaneval: 0.305\n572\t    standard_sft_20_humaneval_stderr: 0.036\n573\t    unpruned_sft_math500: 0.524\n574\t    unpruned_sft_humaneval: 0.549\n575\t    recovery_ratio_gsm8k: 0.73\n576\t    recovery_ratio_math500: 0.544\n577\t    recovery_ratio_humaneval: 0.556\n578\t    ood_degradation_pp: 18.6\n579\t  result_rationale: 'Standard SFT从1%(post-prune)恢复到59.29%(GSM8K)看似impressive（+58pp），\n580\t    但OOD evaluation揭示这部分recovery是GSM8K-specific。 MATH-500 28.5%（recovery ratio 54.4%\n581\t    vs GSM8K的73%）——MATH-500需要更复杂的 multi-step reasoning，pruning damage对这类task影响更大，且SFT\n582\t    on GSM8K gold 不能transfer reasoning chain construction ability to harder problems。\n583\t    HumanEval 30.5%（ratio 55.6%）——code tasks需要不同的能力分布，GSM8K-specific SFT 不提供code generation\n584\t    ability恢复。 OOD degradation证明pruned model的SFT recovery部分是\"pattern reconstruction\n585\t    on GSM8K\" 而非\"genuine reasoning ability recovery\"。这为future work（multi-domain recovery\n586\t    data） 提供了动机。\n587\t\n588\t    '\n589\t  tables:\n590\t  - 'Table 8: OOD evaluation — Standard SFT 20% on MATH-500 (28.5%) and HumanEval\n591\t    (30.5%)'\n592\t  figures_description:\n593\t  - 'Appendix: Recovery ratio by benchmark bar chart'\n594\t  analysis: 'OOD eval在median tier下是contingency experiment（only needed if GRPO RASP\n595\t    advantage <5pp， which it is: -0.84pp）。结果confirms SFT recovery的domain specificity。\n596\t    Paper discussion中acknowledge: \"SFT recovery on in-domain data partially reconstructs\n597\t    task-specific patterns rather than general reasoning capability.\"\n598\t\n599\t    '\n600\t- name: Qwen-Math-7B GRPO at 20% (re-run)\n601\t  plan_id: scope_qwen_math_grpo_20\n602\t  description: Qwen2.5-Math-7B上RASP/Standard 20%的GRPO训练，验证cross-model collapse\n603\t  expected_results:\n604\t    rasp_20_sft_ref: 0.725\n605\t    standard_20_sft_ref: 0.71\n606\t    rasp_20_grpo_collapse_step: 12\n607\t    rasp_20_grpo_peak_reward: 0.028\n608\t    rasp_20_grpo_final_frac_zero_std: 0.88\n609\t    standard_20_grpo_collapse_step: 18\n610\t    standard_20_grpo_peak_reward: 0.045\n611\t    standard_20_grpo_final_frac_zero_std: 0.82\n612\t    post_grpo_rasp_accuracy: 0.718\n613\t    post_grpo_standard_accuracy: 0.705\n614\t    collapse_ratio: 1.5\n615\t    collapse_ratio_ci_95:\n616\t    - 0.8\n617\t    - 2.8\n618\t    rasp_vs_standard_collapse_overlap: true\n619\t  result_rationale: 'Qwen-Math-7B与DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B虽然share Qwen2.5 backbone但training\n620\t    paradigm 不同——Qwen-Math是math-specific SFT，DeepSeek-R1-Distill是reasoning distillation。\n621\t    两者的internal redundancy分布不同，导致RASP和Standard在Qwen-Math上的CKA-based selection differential更小。\n622\t    GRPO collapse在两者上都发生（confirming Claim 1 cross-model），但RASP step 12 vs Standard\n623\t    step 18 的ratio仅1.5x（vs DeepSeek的6x），且95% CI [0.8, 2.8]包含1——不显著。 这是因为Qwen-Math的math-specific\n624\t    training使层间redundancy更均匀分布， RASP和Standard的pruning selection差异更小，导致collapse dynamics差异缩小。\n625\t\n626\t    '\n627\t  tables:\n628\t  - 'Table 5: Cross-model results — Qwen-Math-7B GRPO collapse dynamics'\n629\t  figures_description:\n630\t  - 'Fig 8: Cross-model collapse timing comparison (DeepSeek vs Qwen-Math)'\n631\t  analysis: 'Cross-model evidence confirms Claim 1（GRPO collapse在不同model上都发生）， 但weakens\n632\t    Claim 2——collapse severity gradient在Qwen-Math上不clean。 Paper rewording: \"The collapse\n633\t    severity gradient is a diagnostic tendency observed on DeepSeek-R1-Distill, with\n634\t    directionally consistent but not statistically significant replication on Qwen2.5-Math-7B.\"\n635\t\n636\t    '\n637\t- name: Qwen-Math-7B GRPO at 25%\n638\t  plan_id: scope_qwen_math_grpo_25\n639\t  description: Qwen2.5-Math-7B上RASP/Standard 25%的GRPO训练\n640\t  expected_results:\n641\t    rasp_25_sft_ref: 0.64\n642\t    standard_25_sft_ref: 0.63\n643\t    rasp_25_grpo_collapse_step: 8\n644\t    rasp_25_grpo_peak_reward: 0.015\n645\t    rasp_25_grpo_final_frac_zero_std: 0.93\n646\t    standard_25_grpo_collapse_step: 14\n647\t    standard_25_grpo_peak_reward: 0.031\n648\t    standard_25_grpo_final_frac_zero_std: 0.87\n649\t    post_grpo_rasp_accuracy: 0.632\n650\t    post_grpo_standard_accuracy: 0.624\n651\t    collapse_ratio: 1.75\n652\t    collapse_ratio_ci_95:\n653\t    - 0.9\n654\t    - 3.1\n655\t  result_rationale: '25%稀疏度在Qwen-Math上进一步加速collapse：RASP step 8, Standard step 14。\n656\t    Ratio从1.5(20%)略增到1.75(25%)，因为higher sparsity使differential effects marginally stronger。\n657\t    但CI仍包含1——RASP vs Standard的差异在cross-model设置下not significant。 SFT gap仅1pp（64% vs\n658\t    63%），进一步confirm CKA-aware selection在不同model architecture 的internal redundancy\n659\t    distribution下不produce consistent advantage。 两者都collapse confirms GRPO failure的robustness\n660\t    across models and sparsity levels。\n661\t\n662\t    '\n663\t  tables:\n664\t  - 'Table 5 新增25%行: Qwen-Math-7B 25% sparsity GRPO results'\n665\t  figures_description:\n666\t  - 'Fig 8 extended: 25% sparsity collapse timing for Qwen-Math'\n667\t  analysis: '25% Qwen-Math结果与20%方向一致但仍not significant。 Paper conclusion: GRPO collapse\n668\t    is robust across models (Claim 1 strong), but the severity gradient as a diagnostic\n669\t    tool requires further model diversity to establish generality (Claim 2 hedged).'\n670\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9d5d0222-b1c1-4be8-b4de-29f6a4e65a4a","uuid":"2421258f-1652-4cd3-a755-e46b31ea9c2c","timestamp":"2026-05-16T15:34:02.481Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_17/projects/recovery_aware_struct_prune/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260516T144805/median/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: 'Claim 1（GRPO universal failure）是论文最强贡献——unpruned reward 0→0.661而accuracy\n  0pp变化已确认， 所有pruned配置叠加training collapse。Claim 2（collapse severity gradient）在主模型成立（RASP\n  step~10 << Standard step~60）， 但Qwen-Math-7B跨模型证据中RASP与Standard collapse步数重叠，需从\"clean\n  diagnostic\"弱化为\"diagnostic tendency\"。 Claim 3（Redundancy-Stability Tradeoff）从fundamental\n  principle降级为\"empirical observation on DeepSeek-R1 family\"—— 25% SFT gap仅3-5pp（p~0.09），跨模型方向一致但分离度不够。论文仍可投EMNLP\n  Main，但Discussion需诚实承认 generalization limitation。Unstructured pruning baseline（plan_017）是关键补充——structured\n  pruning导致collapse而 unstructured不会，这直接支持structural damage hypothesis并回应Self-Healing\n  comparison。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: Post-prune baselines N=1319 (20%)\n  plan_id: plan_001\n  description: 将post-prune评估从N=100扩展到N=1319，获得±2.4pp CI用于论文Table 1\n  expected_results:\n    unpruned_original_accuracy: 0.854\n    unpruned_original_correct: 1127\n    unpruned_original_n: 1319\n    unpruned_original_stderr: 0.0097\n    rasp_20_postprune_accuracy: 0.298\n    rasp_20_postprune_correct: 393\n    rasp_20_postprune_stderr: 0.0126\n    rasp_20_eos_rate: 0.89\n    rasp_20_avg_len: 782\n    standard_20_postprune_accuracy: 0.261\n    standard_20_postprune_correct: 344\n    standard_20_postprune_stderr: 0.0121\n    standard_20_eos_rate: 0.82\n    standard_20_avg_len: 1145\n    rasp_vs_standard_gap_pp: 3.7\n    rasp_vs_standard_p_value: 0.034\n  result_rationale: 'N=100数据（RASP 31%, Standard 27%）的点估计在扩展到N=1319后预计小幅回落—— N=100的CI为±9pp，真值可能偏低。CI从±9pp收窄到±2.5pp后，3.7pp\n    gap在post-prune阶段 达到弱显著（p=0.034），但这不是论文核心贡献。原始模型85.4%作为pruning damage的参照锚点。 Post-prune\n    EOS率差异（RASP 89% vs Standard 82%）反映Standard对generation流畅性的更大破坏。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'Table 1: Post-prune accuracy across methods — RASP 29.8% vs Standard 26.1% vs\n    Unpruned 85.4%'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 2 bar chart第一组: Post-prune accuracy对比，三种方法+unpruned baseline'\n  analysis: 'Post-prune gap（3.7pp）在N=1319下弱显著，确认RASP的CKA-aware selection保留了slightly\n    more functional capacity。但核心意义不在此——pruning后两者都丧失70%+能力，关键在recovery差异。\n\n    '\n- name: All recovered models full eval N=1319\n  plan_id: plan_004\n  description: 整合所有recovery路径的N=1319评估，构建论文核心Table 2\n  expected_results:\n    rasp_sft_accuracy: 0.6149\n    rasp_sft_correct: 811\n    standard_sft_accuracy: 0.5929\n    standard_sft_correct: 782\n    sft_gap_pp: 2.2\n    sft_gap_p_value: 0.25\n    rasp_grpo_step5_accuracy: 0.6065\n    rasp_grpo_step5_correct: 800\n    standard_grpo_step50_accuracy: 0.5891\n    standard_grpo_step50_correct: 777\n    unpruned_sft_accuracy: 0.8127\n    unpruned_grpo_step100_accuracy: 0.8127\n    unpruned_grpo_step100_correct: 1072\n    unpruned_grpo_delta_pp: 0.0\n    grpo_delta_rasp_pp: -0.84\n    grpo_delta_standard_pp: -0.38\n    grasp_sft_accuracy_n1319: 0.395\n    grasp_sft_correct_n1319: 521\n    grasp_grpo_accuracy_n1319: 0.388\n  result_rationale: '已有数据已完整确认核心pattern: unpruned GRPO accuracy=SFT accuracy（1072/1319完全相同），\n    RASP和Standard GRPO均不优于SFT（甚至微降）。GRASPrune post-SFT从N=100的41%在N=1319 预计轻微下降至~39.5%（N=100\n    CI较宽）。GRASPrune post-GRPO预计~38.8%，同样无法从GRPO获益。 所有recovery路径都确认Claim 1: GRPO reward-accuracy\n    decoupling is universal。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'Table 2: Recovery accuracy matrix — rows=method (RASP/Standard/GRASPrune/Unpruned),\n    cols=recovery (Post-prune/SFT/GRPO)'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 2 grouped bar chart: 4 methods × 3 recovery stages，展示pruning damage和recovery\n    trajectory'\n  analysis: '核心发现已confirm: GRPO在所有配置下都不改善accuracy。SFT gap 2.2pp (p=0.25)不显著—— 在median\n    tier下报告为\"consistent trend\"而非\"significant result\"。GRASPrune作为external baseline进一步strengthen\n    Claim 1。\n\n    '\n- name: GRASPrune full pipeline (20%)\n  plan_id: plan_005\n  description: 'GRASPrune (ACL 2026 SOTA) 20%稀疏度完整pipeline: prune→eval→SFT→GRPO'\n  expected_results:\n    postprune_accuracy_n1319: 0.068\n    postprune_correct: 90\n    postprune_eos_rate: 0.03\n    postprune_avg_len: 3950\n    post_sft_accuracy_n1319: 0.395\n    post_sft_correct: 521\n    post_sft_eos_rate: 0.96\n    grpo_collapse_step: 18\n    grpo_peak_reward: 0.012\n    grpo_peak_reward_step: 10\n    grpo_final_frac_zero_std: 0.92\n    grpo_final_grad_norm: 0.008\n    post_grpo_accuracy_n1319: 0.388\n    post_grpo_delta_vs_sft_pp: -0.7\n  result_rationale: 'GRASPrune的gate-based importance scoring造成最大structural damage（post-prune\n    7%）， 因为gate training优化output preservation但不考虑结构冗余——它aggressive地同时移除了 important和redundant\n    structures。SFT恢复到39.5%但远低于RASP(61.5%)/Standard(59.3%)， 因为deeper structural damage限制了SFT的function\n    redistribution能力。 GRPO collapse在step~18，介于RASP(10)和Standard(60)之间——GRASPrune的gate\n    training 意外保留了部分redundant结构（它们恰好有低gradient importance），所以比RASP慢collapse， 但远不如Standard，因为整体structural\n    capacity太低（39.5% SFT baseline）。 Peak reward仅0.012（vs RASP 0.039, Standard 0.065），确认reward\n    signal与starting accuracy相关。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'Table 2 新增行: GRASPrune — 6.8% / 39.5% / 38.8%'\n  - 'Table 3 新增行: GRASPrune collapse step ~18, peak reward 0.012'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 1 新增曲线: GRASPrune GRPO training dynamics (reward, frac_zero_std vs step)'\n  - 'Fig 2 新增组: GRASPrune recovery trajectory bar'\n  analysis: 'GRASPrune作为ACL 2026 SOTA external baseline强化了论文的generality: 即使最先进的 structured\n    pruning method也无法避免GRPO collapse。其collapse timing(step 18)处于 RASP(10)和Standard(60)之间，为Claim\n    2的severity gradient增加了第四个data point， 支持collapse速度与structural damage类型的关联性。\n\n    '\n- name: Multi-seed post-prune eval (5 seeds)\n  plan_id: plan_006\n  description: 5个随机种子的post-prune评估，建立RASP vs Standard variance estimation\n  expected_results:\n    rasp_20_mean_accuracy: 0.304\n    rasp_20_std: 0.028\n    rasp_20_seed_results:\n    - 0.31\n    - 0.28\n    - 0.33\n    - 0.29\n    - 0.31\n    standard_20_mean_accuracy: 0.265\n    standard_20_std: 0.032\n    standard_20_seed_results:\n    - 0.27\n    - 0.24\n    - 0.3\n    - 0.22\n    - 0.29\n    pairwise_gap_mean_pp: 3.9\n    pairwise_gap_std: 2.1\n    paired_t_test_p: 0.024\n    cohen_d: 0.58\n    seeds_used:\n    - 42\n    - 123\n    - 456\n    - 789\n    - 1024\n  result_rationale: 'Structured pruning对calibration data敏感——calibration batch的随机性影响哪些structures\n    被选中pruning。5个种子下RASP的variance（σ=2.8pp）略低于Standard（σ=3.2pp），因为 CKA-aware scoring提供了额外的稳定性信号（redundancy\n    estimation跨seeds更一致）。 Paired t-test p=0.024达到显著，因为paired design消除了seed-level共变量。\n    但Cohen''s d=0.58属于中等效应量，不足以称为\"strong advantage\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'Table 1 supplement: Mean±std post-prune accuracy across 5 seeds'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Appendix box plot: 5-seed post-prune accuracy distribution, RASP vs Standard'\n  analysis: '5-seed paired test达到显著（p=0.024），但效应量中等（d=0.58）。在median tier下 这支持\"RASP\n    provides a consistent small advantage in structure selection\"， 但不足以成为论文主要卖点——核心贡献仍是GRPO\n    collapse phenomenon。\n\n    '\n- name: Scoring ablation (magnitude/gradient/random)\n  plan_id: plan_007\n  description: 20%稀疏度下magnitude-only、gradient-only、random pruning scoring对比\n  expected_results:\n    magnitude_only_accuracy: 0.24\n    magnitude_only_eos_rate: 0.78\n    gradient_only_accuracy: 0.28\n    gradient_only_eos_rate: 0.85\n    random_accuracy: 0.17\n    random_eos_rate: 0.45\n    random_avg_len: 2680\n    rasp_ref: 0.31\n    standard_ref: 0.27\n    ordering: RASP(31%) > gradient(28%) ≈ Standard(27%) > magnitude(24%) > random(17%)\n    cka_marginal_contribution_pp: 3.0\n  result_rationale: 'Standard ≈ importance(gradient×magnitude)，所以gradient-only(28%)接近Standard(27%)——\n    magnitude信息对gradient已有的信号增量很小。Magnitude-only(24%)丢失了gradient的 task-specific信号，退化到只看权重大小。Random(17%)是下界——无信息选择。\n    RASP(31%)相对gradient-only(28%)的3pp增量就是CKA(functional redundancy)的marginal contribution。这3pp很小但方向一致，说明CKA提供了互补但non-dominant的信号。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'Table 6: Scoring ablation — Random(17%) < Magnitude(24%) < Gradient(28%) ≈ Standard(27%)\n    < RASP(31%)'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 3 ablation bar chart: 5种scoring方法的post-prune accuracy对比'\n  analysis: 'CKA的marginal contribution仅3pp，说明在post-prune阶段CKA是helpful but not decisive的\n    补充信号。核心pruning quality仍由gradient/importance决定。CKA的关键价值在GRPO collapse differential（Claim\n    2）而非post-prune accuracy（Claim 3的弱化体现）。\n\n    '\n- name: CKA-recoverability correlation analysis\n  plan_id: plan_008\n  description: Per-head F(h) vs post-recovery activation change的mixed-effects regression\n  expected_results:\n    overall_pearson_r: 0.38\n    overall_p_value: 0.003\n    within_layer_r: 0.22\n    within_layer_p: 0.041\n    between_layer_variance_explained: 0.62\n    within_layer_variance_explained: 0.08\n    mixed_effects_fixed_slope: 0.31\n    mixed_effects_random_intercept_sd: 0.18\n    layer_icc: 0.71\n    control_weight_norm_partial_r: 0.12\n    control_grad_importance_partial_r: 0.15\n    n_heads_analyzed: 224\n  result_rationale: 'F(h)（CKA-based functional redundancy score）在层间水平与recovery后activation\n    change 显著相关（r=0.38），因为不同层的redundancy基线差异大——早期层功能高度冗余，深层更specialized。 但within-layer的预测力弱（r=0.22），因为同层内heads的redundancy差异小，\n    局部connectivity和positional encoding效应主导了recovery dynamics。 Layer ICC=0.71意味着71%的variance在层间，仅29%在层内。这解释了为什么CKA-aware\n    pruning （RASP）在post-prune阶段只提供marginal advantage——大部分可利用的信号在层级选择， 而RASP和Standard在层级分配上差异不大（都优先剪浅层MLP）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'Table 9 (Appendix): Mixed-effects regression coefficients'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 4: Scatter plot of F(h) vs ΔActivation, colored by layer depth, with regression\n    line'\n  - 'Appendix: ICC by layer bar chart'\n  analysis: 'CKA作为recoverability predictor在macro level有效但micro level较弱。 这直接支持Claim\n    3的弱化版本——CKA captures a real signal（r=0.38, p=0.003）， 但不足以成为\"fundamental principle\"级别的predictor。报告为\"CKA\n    identifies a meaningful but layer-dominated redundancy signal\"。\n\n    '\n- name: SFT-only recovery comparison\n  plan_id: plan_009\n  description: RASP vs Standard在SFT-only recovery下的对比（无GRPO）\n  expected_results:\n    rasp_sft_20_accuracy: 0.6149\n    standard_sft_20_accuracy: 0.5929\n    sft_gap_20_pp: 2.2\n    sft_gap_20_p_value: 0.25\n    rasp_sft_20_loss_final: 0.64\n    standard_sft_20_loss_final: 0.64\n    rasp_sft_20_token_acc: 0.83\n    standard_sft_20_token_acc: 0.83\n    learning_curve_crossover_step: null\n    convergence_step_rasp: 1400\n    convergence_step_standard: 1350\n  result_rationale: 'SFT-only数据已有（RASP 61.49%, Standard 59.29%, gap 2.2pp, p=0.25）。\n    两者训练dynamics几乎完全相同——final loss 0.64, token accuracy 83%——表明 SFT的teacher-forcing机制能equally\n    well地利用不同pruning scheme保留的结构。 CKA-aware pruning在SFT recovery中的advantage是marginal的：SFT通过梯度下降\n    重新分配功能到remaining structures，不太依赖原始redundancy patterns。 Gap方向一致（RASP > Standard）但magnitude不足以达到significance\n    at N=1319。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'Table 2 SFT-only列: RASP 61.5% vs Standard 59.3% (p=0.25)'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Appendix: SFT training loss curves对比 (RASP vs Standard, nearly identical)'\n  analysis: 'SFT-only comparison确认Claim 3的一半：SFT recovery下RASP advantage是marginal。\n    与GRPO collapse的dramatic差异形成对比——optimal pruning确实depends on recovery paradigm，\n    但SFT方向的evidence弱于GRPO方向。\n\n    '\n- name: 25% sparsity full pipeline\n  plan_id: plan_010\n  description: 25%稀疏度RASP+Standard完整pipeline (prune→SFT→GRPO)，验证sparsity scaling\n  expected_results:\n    postprune_rasp_25: 0.21\n    postprune_standard_25: 0.16\n    sft_rasp_25_accuracy: 0.5449\n    sft_rasp_25_correct: 719\n    sft_rasp_25_stderr: 0.0137\n    sft_standard_25_accuracy: 0.5125\n    sft_standard_25_correct: 676\n    sft_gap_25_pp: 3.24\n    sft_gap_25_p_value: 0.089\n    grpo_rasp_25_collapse_step: 7\n    grpo_rasp_25_peak_reward: 0.018\n    grpo_rasp_25_peak_frac_zero_std: 0.97\n    grpo_rasp_25_final_grad_norm: 0.005\n    grpo_standard_25_collapse_step: 30\n    grpo_standard_25_peak_reward: 0.042\n    grpo_standard_25_step30_frac_zero_std: 0.72\n    grpo_standard_25_transient_recovery: false\n    grpo_standard_25_final_reward: 0.028\n    post_grpo_rasp_25_accuracy: 0.535\n    post_grpo_standard_25_accuracy: 0.505\n    collapse_ratio_rasp_vs_standard: 4.3\n  result_rationale: '25%稀疏度放大所有效应： (1) SFT gap从2.2pp扩大到3.24pp（p=0.089）——更多结构移除使RASP的CKA-aware\n    selection 产生更大differential effect，但p仍在[0.05,0.15]范围内，属于marginal。 (2) GRPO collapse加速——RASP从step~10降到step~7，Standard从step~60降到step~30。\n    两者都因更少structural capacity而更快collapse。但ratio从6x(20%)降到4.3x(25%)， 因为Standard在25%下也开始失去redundancy，两者向同一个floor\n    convergence。 (3) Standard在25%下不再有transient recovery（20%时step~60 dip后recovered\n    to step~90）—— 25%的structural capacity不足以支持recovery。 这是median tier的核心: collapse\n    gradient存在但\"不如20%那么干净\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'Table 1 新增25%行: RASP 21%→54.5%→53.5%, Standard 16%→51.3%→50.5%'\n  - 'Table 3 新增25%行: collapse steps and dynamics'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 1 新增panel: 25% GRPO training dynamics (reward, frac_zero_std curves)'\n  - 'Fig 5: Collapse step vs sparsity level line plot (20% and 25%, RASP vs Standard)'\n  analysis: '25%数据是Claim 2的关键支撑——collapse severity gradient在两个sparsity levels上成立。\n    但ratio compression（6x→4.3x）和Standard失去recovery能力说明gradient在高sparsity下变noisy。 SFT\n    gap 3.24pp（p=0.089）是论文能报告的最强SFT evidence——在median tier下报告为 \"marginally significant\n    trend (p<0.1) that amplifies with sparsity\"。\n\n    '\n- name: 30% sparsity probe (prune + eval only)\n  plan_id: plan_011\n  description: 30%稀疏度RASP+Standard post-prune评估，mapping practical sparsity ceiling\n  expected_results:\n    rasp_30_postprune_accuracy: 0.12\n    rasp_30_postprune_stderr: 0.032\n    rasp_30_eos_rate: 0.38\n    rasp_30_avg_len: 2850\n    standard_30_postprune_accuracy: 0.09\n    standard_30_postprune_stderr: 0.029\n    standard_30_eos_rate: 0.31\n    standard_30_avg_len: 3200\n    gap_pp: 3.0\n    gap_p_value: 0.48\n  result_rationale: '30%稀疏度接近structured pruning的实际上限——从25%(RASP 21%, Standard 16%)到30%，\n    accuracy再降约50%。两者都接近random chance on GSM8K（~10-12%可能仅靠简单算术题得分）。 EOS率极低（RASP 38%,\n    Standard 31%）表明模型generation能力严重受损，大量输出截断。 Gap（3pp）在这个低accuracy下无统计意义（p=0.48），因为variance极大。\n    与D005的35%结果（total collapse）一致——30%是collapse onset，35%是complete failure。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'Table 1 新增30%行: RASP 12% vs Standard 9% (post-prune only)'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 5 extended: Sparsity vs post-prune accuracy curve (20%, 25%, 30%), marking\n    practical ceiling'\n  analysis: '确认~25-30%为DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B的structured pruning practical ceiling。\n    不进行recovery实验因为starting point太低（<15%）。Paper discussion中报告为 \"structured pruning\n    beyond 25% is impractical for this model class\"。\n\n    '\n- name: Extended eval (MMLU, HumanEval, MATH-500)\n  plan_id: plan_012\n  description: 最佳recovered config (RASP SFT 20%) + unpruned在三个OOD benchmark上的评估\n  expected_results:\n    rasp_sft_20_math500: 0.318\n    rasp_sft_20_humaneval: 0.354\n    rasp_sft_20_mmlu: 0.512\n    standard_sft_20_math500: 0.298\n    standard_sft_20_humaneval: 0.329\n    standard_sft_20_mmlu: 0.498\n    unpruned_sft_math500: 0.524\n    unpruned_sft_humaneval: 0.549\n    unpruned_sft_mmlu: 0.638\n    unpruned_original_math500: 0.558\n    unpruned_original_humaneval: 0.561\n    unpruned_original_mmlu: 0.651\n    recovery_ratio_gsm8k: 0.757\n    recovery_ratio_math500: 0.607\n    recovery_ratio_humaneval: 0.645\n    recovery_ratio_mmlu: 0.803\n  result_rationale: 'SFT recovery在GSM8K上恢复到75.7%（RASP 61.5% / Unpruned 81.3%），但OOD\n    benchmark 恢复率显著更低：MATH-500仅60.7%，HumanEval 64.5%。这是因为SFT teacher-forcing使用 GSM8K\n    gold solutions，recovery部分是GSM8K-specific pattern重建而非通用reasoning能力恢复。 MMLU恢复率最高(80.3%)因为factual\n    knowledge主要存储在embedding层和attention patterns中， structured pruning主要移除MLP groups（占pruned\n    structures的100%），对factual recall影响较小。 RASP vs Standard gap在OOD上方向一致但magnitude更小（MATH-500:\n    2pp, MMLU: 1.4pp）， 说明CKA-aware selection的advantage部分是GSM8K-specific的。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'Table 8: Extended eval — accuracy by benchmark and method'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 6 (Appendix): Recovery ratio by benchmark grouped bar chart'\n  analysis: 'OOD evaluation reveals SFT recovery的domain specificity。核心message: pruned\n    model recovers 75%+ capability on in-domain (GSM8K) but only 60-65% on harder\n    math/code tasks。 这strengthens the argument for better recovery methods——current\n    SFT pipeline有inherent limitation。 对Claim 3补充了nuance: RASP advantage在OOD上diminishes。\n\n    '\n- name: Bonsai baseline (20%)\n  plan_id: plan_013\n  description: Bonsai (ICML 2025, gradient-free) 20%稀疏度作为第三个external baseline\n  expected_results:\n    postprune_accuracy_n100: 0.19\n    postprune_eos_rate: 0.52\n    post_sft_accuracy_n100: 0.47\n    post_sft_eos_rate: 0.95\n    grpo_collapse_step: 28\n    grpo_peak_reward: 0.022\n    grpo_final_frac_zero_std: 0.88\n    post_grpo_accuracy_n100: 0.46\n  result_rationale: 'Bonsai用activation norm作为pruning criterion（gradient-free），post-prune\n    19%介于 random(17%)和Standard(27%)之间——activation norm是importance的粗略proxy但不如gradient准确。\n    SFT恢复到47%，高于GRASPrune(41%)但低于Standard(59%)，因为Bonsai的structure selection 质量介于random和gradient-based之间。\n    GRPO collapse at step~28——比GRASPrune(18)慢因为Bonsai的简单norm-based selection 意外保留了更多redundant\n    structures（redundant structures often have moderate norms）， 但比Standard(60)快因为overall\n    pruning quality更差。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'Table 2 新增行 (Appendix): Bonsai — 19% / 47% / 46%'\n  - 'Table 3 新增行 (Appendix): Bonsai collapse step ~28'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Appendix: Bonsai training dynamics curve'\n  analysis: 'Bonsai作为gradient-free baseline补全了pruning method spectrum。四种方法的collapse\n    ordering (RASP 10 < GRASPrune 18 < Bonsai 28 < Standard 60)进一步支持Claim 2: collapse速度\n    与pruning method的redundancy removal aggressive度相关。但Bonsai是P2优先级—— 如果GPU budget紧张可以drop，GRASPrune足以作为external\n    baseline。\n\n    '\n- name: CKA reliability analysis\n  plan_id: plan_014\n  description: Split-half consistency和calibration size sensitivity验证CKA scoring稳定性\n  expected_results:\n    split_half_spearman_rho: 0.93\n    split_half_p_value: 1.0e-45\n    cal_256_spearman_rho: 0.88\n    cal_512_spearman_rho: 0.93\n    cal_1024_spearman_rho: 0.95\n    cal_256_accuracy_delta_vs_512: -0.015\n    cal_1024_accuracy_delta_vs_512: 0.008\n    n_structures_scored: 896\n    scoring_time_256_sec: 180\n    scoring_time_512_sec: 340\n    scoring_time_1024_sec: 660\n  result_rationale: 'CKA是kernel-based similarity metric，理论上convergence rate为O(1/√n)——512\n    samples 已足够达到ρ>0.9。Split-half consistency ρ=0.93表明在random half-split下scoring order\n    高度稳定。256→512的提升（0.88→0.93）是主要增量，512→1024仅marginal（0.93→0.95）， 说明512是cost-effective\n    minimum。 Accuracy delta确认scoring stability translates to pruning outcome stability:\n    cal=256 vs cal=512仅相差1.5pp post-prune accuracy，cal=1024 vs 512仅0.8pp。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'Table 10 (Appendix): CKA reliability by calibration size'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Appendix: Spearman ρ vs calibration size curve'\n  analysis: 'CKA scoring在512 samples下已稳定（ρ=0.93），支持RASP的practical usability。 这是一个defensive\n    result——reviewer可能质疑CKA computation的稳定性， 该实验提供conclusive evidence that CKA-based\n    scoring is reliable。\n\n    '\n- name: Alpha sensitivity ablation (full)\n  plan_id: plan_015\n  description: α ∈ {0, 0.25, 0.5, 1, 2} post-prune和post-SFT accuracy sweep\n  expected_results:\n    postprune:\n      alpha_0p0: 0.27\n      alpha_0p25: 0.23\n      alpha_0p5: 0.22\n      alpha_1p0: 0.31\n      alpha_2p0: 0.36\n    post_sft_n1319:\n      alpha_0p0: 0.593\n      alpha_0p25: 0.558\n      alpha_0p5: 0.549\n      alpha_1p0: 0.573\n      alpha_2p0: 0.608\n    post_sft_n100_ref:\n      alpha_0p0: 0.64\n      alpha_0p25: null\n      alpha_0p5: null\n      alpha_1p0: 0.57\n      alpha_2p0: 0.62\n    u_shape_minimum_alpha: 0.5\n    optimal_postprune_alpha: 2.0\n    optimal_postsft_alpha: 2.0\n  result_rationale: 'Post-prune U-shape已由alpha_ablation_sweep确认（α=0.5最低22%, α=2.0最高36%）。\n    Post-SFT结果部分已有（N=100）——在N=1319下预计： α=0.0(=Standard)→59.3%（已确认），α=1.0→57.3%（从N=100的57%微调），α=2.0→60.8%（从N=100的62%微调）。\n    Post-SFT的U-shape被SFT recovery压缩但保留方向——α=2.0在SFT后仍最优，因为它在post-prune 阶段保留了最多functional\n    capacity（36%），给SFT更好的starting point。 α=0.25和α=0.5的post-SFT较低是因为它们在post-prune阶段创造了\"noise\n    injection\"效果—— CKA penalty太小时反而干扰了importance ranking而不是有效补充。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'Table 4: Alpha ablation — post-prune and post-SFT accuracy across α values'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 3: U-shape curve, dual y-axis (post-prune and post-SFT accuracy vs α)'\n  analysis: 'Alpha ablation是reviewer flagged的Critical experiment。U-shape confirms\n    α是meaningful parameter， 不是arbitrary choice。最优α=2.0（非default 1.0）→paper应report\n    this transparently并 讨论为什么aggressive CKA penalty有利（推测：更强地保护unique structures在reasoning\n    LLM中更关键）。 Post-SFT U-shape压缩但保留说明CKA contribution survives recovery——与plan_008的CKA-recoverability\n    correlation一致。\n\n    '\n- name: Inference speedup benchmark\n  plan_id: plan_016\n  description: Dense vs 20% RASP-pruned vs 20% Standard-pruned wall-clock latency和throughput\n  expected_results:\n    dense_latency_ms: 142\n    rasp_20_latency_ms: 121\n    standard_20_latency_ms: 120\n    rasp_20_latency_reduction_pct: 14.8\n    standard_20_latency_reduction_pct: 15.5\n    dense_throughput_tok_s: 85\n    rasp_20_throughput_tok_s: 99\n    standard_20_throughput_tok_s: 100\n    rasp_20_throughput_gain_pct: 16.5\n    standard_20_throughput_gain_pct: 17.6\n    batch_size: 1\n    seq_len: 512\n    gpu: A100-80GB\n    n_runs: 50\n    warmup_runs: 10\n  result_rationale: '20% structured pruning移除~19%的parameters（全部是complete MLP groups），理论speedup为19%。\n    实际latency reduction ~15%因为：(1)非MLP compute（attention, LayerNorm, embedding）不变，\n    占总compute的~25%；(2)不同层的pruning不均匀导致GPU utilization不optimal； (3)framework overhead（PyTorch\n    dynamic shapes）。RASP和Standard的speedup几乎相同 因为sparsity level相同——pruning method影响which\n    structures被移除，不影响total removal量。 Standard微略快（0.7pp）可能是随机variation或因为Standard pruned的structures恰好使\n    layer sizes更uniform。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'Table 7: Inference speedup — latency and throughput comparison'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Appendix: Latency distribution box plot across 50 runs'\n  analysis: '~15% speedup在20% sparsity下是reasonable但不impressive——structured pruning的practical\n    motivation 需要至少25-30% sparsity才能达到meaningful speedup。但这个experiment是reviewer必问的\n    \"where''s the efficiency gain\"的defensive answer。Paper discussion应note that  structured\n    pruning实际speedup低于parameter reduction ratio。\n\n    '\n- name: Unstructured pruning baseline (20%)\n  plan_id: plan_017\n  description: Magnitude-based unstructured pruning 20%作为Self-Healing fair comparison基线\n  expected_results:\n    postprune_accuracy: 0.682\n    postprune_correct: 900\n    postprune_n: 1319\n    postprune_stderr: 0.0128\n    postprune_eos_rate: 0.98\n    post_sft_accuracy: 0.763\n    post_sft_correct: 1007\n    post_sft_stderr: 0.0117\n    grpo_collapse: false\n    grpo_max_steps: 100\n    grpo_final_reward: 0.548\n    grpo_final_frac_zero_std: 0.32\n    grpo_final_grad_norm: 5.82\n    post_grpo_accuracy: 0.758\n    post_grpo_delta_vs_sft_pp: -0.5\n    grpo_reward_accuracy_decoupling: true\n    structured_vs_unstructured_gap_postprune_pp: 38.4\n    structured_vs_unstructured_gap_postsft_pp: 14.8\n  result_rationale: 'Unstructured pruning at 20%仅零化individual weights而不移除structural\n    units——所有224个attention heads和 784个MLP groups保持intact。Post-prune 68.2%远高于structured的30%(RASP)/27%(Standard)，\n    因为每个结构仍有80%的weights functional，network topology完全保留。 SFT恢复到76.3%——接近unpruned(81.3%)，gap仅5pp，因为结构完整性使SFT只需微调权重而非重建功能。\n    GRPO关键发现：NO COLLAPSE。100步训练stable（frac_zero_std<0.35, grad_norm~5.8）， reward达到0.548（vs\n    unpruned 0.661）。但accuracy仍不改善（76.3→75.8, Δ=-0.5pp）—— reward-accuracy decoupling在unstructured\n    pruned model上也成立（Claim 1 strengthened）， 但没有training collapse。 这直接支持structural\n    damage hypothesis: collapse是structural pruning的specific consequence （移除entire\n    exploration pathways），不是pruning in general的问题。Unstructured pruning 保留了所有structural\n    redundancy，因此GRPO可以stable训练。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'Table 2 新增行: Unstructured 20% — 68.2% / 76.3% / 75.8%'\n  - 'Table 3 新增行: Unstructured — no collapse, 100 steps stable'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 1 新增panel: Unstructured GRPO dynamics (stable reward, no frac_zero_std spike)'\n  - 'Fig 7: Structured vs Unstructured comparison — collapse is structural-pruning-specific'\n  analysis: '这是median tier最关键的补充实验。Unstructured pruning确认了两个核心insights: (1) Reward-accuracy\n    decoupling is universal（连unstructured也有reward↑ accuracy=），strengthening Claim\n    1; (2) Training collapse is structural-pruning-specific（unstructured无collapse），confirming\n    the structural damage mechanism。 对Self-Healing comparison: Self-Healing用25% unstructured报告recovery——我们在20%\n    unstructured 也看到无collapse，但accuracy仍不从GRPO获益。Paper可argue: Self-Healing的\"RLVR recovery\"\n    可能只是reward improvement without accuracy gain，需要replication with accuracy evaluation。\n\n    '\n- name: SFT OOD eval (Standard 20%)\n  plan_id: plan_018\n  description: Standard SFT 20% (59.29% GSM8K)在MATH-500和HumanEval上的OOD评估\n  expected_results:\n    standard_sft_20_math500: 0.285\n    standard_sft_20_math500_stderr: 0.02\n    standard_sft_20_humaneval: 0.305\n    standard_sft_20_humaneval_stderr: 0.036\n    unpruned_sft_math500: 0.524\n    unpruned_sft_humaneval: 0.549\n    recovery_ratio_gsm8k: 0.73\n    recovery_ratio_math500: 0.544\n    recovery_ratio_humaneval: 0.556\n    ood_degradation_pp: 18.6\n  result_rationale: 'Standard SFT从1%(post-prune)恢复到59.29%(GSM8K)看似impressive（+58pp），\n    但OOD evaluation揭示这部分recovery是GSM8K-specific。 MATH-500 28.5%（recovery ratio 54.4%\n    vs GSM8K的73%）——MATH-500需要更复杂的 multi-step reasoning，pruning damage对这类task影响更大，且SFT\n    on GSM8K gold 不能transfer reasoning chain construction ability to harder problems。\n    HumanEval 30.5%（ratio 55.6%）——code tasks需要不同的能力分布，GSM8K-specific SFT 不提供code generation\n    ability恢复。 OOD degradation证明pruned model的SFT recovery部分是\"pattern reconstruction\n    on GSM8K\" 而非\"genuine reasoning ability recovery\"。这为future work（multi-domain recovery\n    data） 提供了动机。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'Table 8: OOD evaluation — Standard SFT 20% on MATH-500 (28.5%) and HumanEval\n    (30.5%)'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Appendix: Recovery ratio by benchmark bar chart'\n  analysis: 'OOD eval在median tier下是contingency experiment（only needed if GRPO RASP\n    advantage <5pp， which it is: -0.84pp）。结果confirms SFT recovery的domain specificity。\n    Paper discussion中acknowledge: \"SFT recovery on in-domain data partially reconstructs\n    task-specific patterns rather than general reasoning capability.\"\n\n    '\n- name: Qwen-Math-7B GRPO at 20% (re-run)\n  plan_id: scope_qwen_math_grpo_20\n  description: Qwen2.5-Math-7B上RASP/Standard 20%的GRPO训练，验证cross-model collapse\n  expected_results:\n    rasp_20_sft_ref: 0.725\n    standard_20_sft_ref: 0.71\n    rasp_20_grpo_collapse_step: 12\n    rasp_20_grpo_peak_reward: 0.028\n    rasp_20_grpo_final_frac_zero_std: 0.88\n    standard_20_grpo_collapse_step: 18\n    standard_20_grpo_peak_reward: 0.045\n    standard_20_grpo_final_frac_zero_std: 0.82\n    post_grpo_rasp_accuracy: 0.718\n    post_grpo_standard_accuracy: 0.705\n    collapse_ratio: 1.5\n    collapse_ratio_ci_95:\n    - 0.8\n    - 2.8\n    rasp_vs_standard_collapse_overlap: true\n  result_rationale: 'Qwen-Math-7B与DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B虽然share Qwen2.5 backbone但training\n    paradigm 不同——Qwen-Math是math-specific SFT，DeepSeek-R1-Distill是reasoning distillation。\n    两者的internal redundancy分布不同，导致RASP和Standard在Qwen-Math上的CKA-based selection differential更小。\n    GRPO collapse在两者上都发生（confirming Claim 1 cross-model），但RASP step 12 vs Standard\n    step 18 的ratio仅1.5x（vs DeepSeek的6x），且95% CI [0.8, 2.8]包含1——不显著。 这是因为Qwen-Math的math-specific\n    training使层间redundancy更均匀分布， RASP和Standard的pruning selection差异更小，导致collapse dynamics差异缩小。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'Table 5: Cross-model results — Qwen-Math-7B GRPO collapse dynamics'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 8: Cross-model collapse timing comparison (DeepSeek vs Qwen-Math)'\n  analysis: 'Cross-model evidence confirms Claim 1（GRPO collapse在不同model上都发生）， 但weakens\n    Claim 2——collapse severity gradient在Qwen-Math上不clean。 Paper rewording: \"The collapse\n    severity gradient is a diagnostic tendency observed on DeepSeek-R1-Distill, with\n    directionally consistent but not statistically significant replication on Qwen2.5-Math-7B.\"\n\n    '\n- name: Qwen-Math-7B GRPO at 25%\n  plan_id: scope_qwen_math_grpo_25\n  description: Qwen2.5-Math-7B上RASP/Standard 25%的GRPO训练\n  expected_results:\n    rasp_25_sft_ref: 0.64\n    standard_25_sft_ref: 0.63\n    rasp_25_grpo_collapse_step: 8\n    rasp_25_grpo_peak_reward: 0.015\n    rasp_25_grpo_final_frac_zero_std: 0.93\n    standard_25_grpo_collapse_step: 14\n    standard_25_grpo_peak_reward: 0.031\n    standard_25_grpo_final_frac_zero_std: 0.87\n    post_grpo_rasp_accuracy: 0.632\n    post_grpo_standard_accuracy: 0.624\n    collapse_ratio: 1.75\n    collapse_ratio_ci_95:\n    - 0.9\n    - 3.1\n  result_rationale: '25%稀疏度在Qwen-Math上进一步加速collapse：RASP step 8, Standard step 14。\n    Ratio从1.5(20%)略增到1.75(25%)，因为higher sparsity使differential effects marginally stronger。\n    但CI仍包含1——RASP vs Standard的差异在cross-model设置下not significant。 SFT gap仅1pp（64% vs\n    63%），进一步confirm CKA-aware selection在不同model architecture 的internal redundancy\n    distribution下不produce consistent advantage。 两者都collapse confirms GRPO failure的robustness\n    across models and sparsity levels。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'Table 5 新增25%行: Qwen-Math-7B 25% sparsity GRPO results'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 8 extended: 25% sparsity collapse timing for Qwen-Math'\n  analysis: '25% Qwen-Math结果与20%方向一致但仍not significant。 Paper conclusion: GRPO collapse\n    is robust across models (Claim 1 strong), but the severity gradient as a diagnostic\n    tool requires further model diversity to establish generality (Claim 2 hedged).'\n","numLines":670,"startLine":1,"totalLines":670}}}
