{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01E4AQobexVfTqv4QCTqP3ez","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_17/projects/recovery_aware_struct_prune/report.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Handover — 2026-05-16\\\\n\\\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中\\\\n| exp_id | 假设 | 状态 | 关键指标 | W&B |\\\\n|--------|------|------|---------|-----|\\\\n| eval_sft_rasp_rlvr_20 | RASP-RLVR 20% post-SFT GSM8K eval (N=1319, greedy, seed=42). 验证反向 CKA scoring 的 RLVR 恢复效果。对比 RASP SFT (61.49%) 和 Standard SFT (59.29%)。Parent: sft_rasp_rlvr_20. | — | — | — |\\\\n| grpo_standard_25_qwen_math | Qwen2.5-Math-7B Standard 25% GRPO (100 steps, save_steps=5). 跨模型×跨稀疏度验证 C2: Standard collapse gradient. 对比 20% (grpo_standard_qwen_math) 和 RASP 25% (grpo_rasp_25_qwen_math)。Parent: sft_qwen_math_standard_25. | — | — | — |\\\\n| grpo_rasp_25_qwen_math | Qwen2.5-Math-7B RASP 25% GRPO (100 steps, save_steps=5). 跨模型×跨稀疏度验证 C2: RASP collapse pattern. 对比 20% (grpo_rasp_qwen_math) 和 Standard 25% (grpo_standard_25_qwen_math)。Parent: sft_qwen_math_rasp_25. | — | — | — |\\\\n\\\\n## 待处理\\\\n- grpo_standard_25: Standard 25% GRPO recovery (100 steps). Negative control for grpo_rasp_25. 预期 collapse 比 RASP 更早/更严重（如 20% 所示）。Parent: sft_standard_25.（准备中）\\\\n- grpo_rasp_25: RASP 25% GRPO recovery (100 steps). 预期 collapse 比 20% 更快更严重。与 grpo_standard_25 对比验证 C3: recovery method conditions pruning order. Parent: sft_rasp_25.（准备中）\\\\n- eval_postprune_25: 25% post-prune accuracy eval (N=100, greedy, seed=42) for both pruned_rasp_25 and pruned_standard_25. 补之前失败的数据点，对比 20% sparsity post-prune (RASP 31% vs Standard 27%)。（准备中）\\\\n- eval_sft_standard_20_n1319: Standard post-SFT full GSM8K eval (N=1319, greedy, seed=42). N=100 result: 64%. Full eval provides tight CI for paper Table 1. Parent: sft_standard_20_retrain.（准备中）\\\\n- eval_sft_grasp_20（准备中）\\\\n- eval_sft_alpha_0p5: α=0.5 post-SFT GSM8K eval (N=100, greedy). Post-prune 25%. Completes full α ablation: α=0.0 (64%), α=0.5 (?), α=1.0 (57%), α=2.0 (pending), α=4.0 (62%). Parent: alpha_ablation_westd_cal256.（准备中）\\\\n- eval_sft_rasp_20_full: RASP post-SFT full GSM8K eval (N=1319, greedy, seed=42). N=100 result: 57%. Full eval provides statistical significance for RASP vs Standard comparison. Parent: sft_rasp_20.（准备中）\\\\n- grpo_standard_20_v8（准备中）\\\\n- grpo_rasp_20_v8（准备中）\\\\n- alpha_ablation_westd_cal256: α ablation sweep (calibration=256, N=100). α∈{0.0,0.5,1.0,2.0,4.0} at 20% sparsity. Phase A (prune+eval) complete, Phase B (SFT) in progress. Note: calibration=256 differs from westb original (512), causing ~5% group selection differences.（准备中）\\\\n- …另有 2 项\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **sft_rasp_rlvr_20** (success): RASP-RLVR 20% post-prune SFT recovery (lr=2e-5, epochs=2). 验证反向 CKA scoring (保留冗余结构) 是否产生更好的 RLVR 恢复基础。对比 RASP SFT 和 Standard SFT。Parent: prune_rasp_rlvr_20.\\\\n- **grpo_standard_qwen_math** (killed): Qwen2.5-Math-7B Standard 20% GRPO (100 steps, save_steps=5). 跨模型验证 C2: Standard collapse gradient (transient dip+recovery). DeepSeek Standard: transient dip step ~60, recovery step ~90. 参数同 grpo_stage2_standard_20_v8。Parent: sft_standard_20_qwen_math.\\\\n- **grpo_rasp_qwen_math** (killed): Qwen2.5-Math-7B RASP 20% GRPO (100 steps, save_steps=5). 跨模型验证 C1/C2: GRPO collapse 是否在 Qwen Math 上复现。DeepSeek RASP collapse onset ~step 10 (permanent). 参数同 grpo_stage2_rasp_20_v9。Parent: sft_rasp_20_qwen_math.\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 52 / 负向 10 / 失败 12 / 共 84\\\\naccuracy: 0.5125 ↓（近 3 次 success）\\\\neos_rate: 0.9545 ↓（近 3 次 success）\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\nwestb-23072: 无 GPU 信息\\\\nwestd-11672: 空闲 cuda:0, cuda:1, cuda:2, cuda:3\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n- mvp_rasp_pipeline: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_rasp_pipeline_v2: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- grpo_rasp_20: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- grpo_standard_20: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- grpo_rasp_20_4096: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- grpo_stage2_rasp_20: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- grpo_stage2_standard_20: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- grpo_stage2_standard_20_v2: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- grpo_stage2_rasp_20_v3: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- grpo_stage2_rasp_20_v4: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- grpo_stage2_rasp_20_v5: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- sft_alpha4_0_westd: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- grpo_stage2_rasp_20_v6: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- grpo_stage2_standard_20_v6: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- grpo_stage2_rasp_20_v7: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- grpo_stage2_standard_20_v7: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- eval_sft_standard_20_full: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- grpo_unpruned_baseline: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- eval_sft_rasp_qwen_math: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- eval_sft_standard_qwen_math: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- grpo_rasp_qwen_math: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- grpo_standard_qwen_math: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 4199, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_019gBJmxYgZGGNCrMCzaXUAT","session_id":"9d5d0222-b1c1-4be8-b4de-29f6a4e65a4a","uuid":"1fafcd36-778c-4d9e-bc04-5e3244045104","timestamp":"2026-05-16T15:35:02.941Z"}
