{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012cCeBK9LkynQdiQTBBShMY","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_17/projects/recovery_aware_struct_prune/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# recovery_aware_struct_prune — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-16 08:05 UTC | 更新原因: D044/D045 narrative pivot complete, 25% expansion in progress, ROADMAP 16h stale refresh\\\\n\\\\n> 核心方向详见 paper_framing.md | 实验计划详见 experiment_plan.yaml\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\n**Redundancy-Stability Tradeoff**: GRPO alignment fundamentally fails on structurally pruned reasoning models — reward improves but accuracy never follows (universal decoupling). Pruning adds training collapse whose severity diagnoses structural damage type. Functional redundancy plays opposite roles under SFT vs RLVR recovery.\\\\n\\\\n## 目标会议\\\\nEMNLP 2026 ARR May 25 提交（距今 ~9 天）\\\\n\\\\n## 当前阶段\\\\n**Research Phase — Scope Expansion** (D044/D045 后)\\\\n- Core 20% data: ✅ ALL COMPLETE (3 claims fully supported)\\\\n- 25% sparsity expansion: SFT 完成, eval 进行中/刚完成, GRPO 待启动\\\\n- Qwen2.5-Math-7B (Phase 2): importance+CKA scores 已算, RASP pruning 进行中\\\\n- Paper writing: Paper Agent Step 2 (Plot Generation) 进行中\\\\n\\\\n## 核心证据 (20% sparsity, N=1319)\\\\n| 实验 | 结果 | Claim |\\\\n|------|------|-------|\\\\n| Unpruned SFT → GRPO step-100 | 81.27% → 81.27% (Δ=0.00, reward 0→0.661) | C1: Universal decoupling |\\\\n| RASP GRPO v9 collapse | Permanent step ~10, peak reward 0.039, frac_zero_std→0.95 | C2: Collapse gradient |\\\\n| Standard GRPO v8 collapse | Transient dip step ~60, recovery step ~90 | C2: Collapse gradient |\\\\n| Unpruned GRPO v2 | 100 steps stable, no collapse, reward 0.661 | C2: Pruning-specificity |\\\\n| RASP SFT vs Standard SFT | 61.49% vs 59.29% (Δ=+2.2pp, p=0.25) | C3: SFT marginal advantage |\\\\n| RASP step-10 eval | 61.87% (collapse onset ≠ accuracy loss) | Bidirectional decoupling |\\\\n\\\\n## Scope Expansion 进度\\\\n### Phase 1: 25% Sparsity (intensify collapse)\\\\n- [x] pruned_rasp_25 + pruned_standard_25\\\\n- [x] sft_rasp_25 + sft_standard_25\\\\n- [ ] eval_sft_standard_25 (刚完成/进行中 — 等 Agent 确认)\\\\n- [ ] eval_sft_rasp_25 (刚完成/进行中 — 等 Agent 确认)\\\\n- [ ] grpo_standard_25 + grpo_rasp_25 (下一步：4张GPU全部投入)\\\\n- [ ] eval 25% GRPO checkpoints\\\\n\\\\n### Phase 2: Qwen2.5-Math-7B (cross-model validation)\\\\n- [x] importance_scores_qwen_math.pt + cka_scores_qwen_math.pt\\\\n- [ ] prune_rasp_20_qwen_math (CPU task, 进行中)\\\\n- [ ] prune_standard_20_qwen_math (进行中)\\\\n- [ ] SFT → GRPO → eval full pipeline\\\\n\\\\n### Paper Writing\\\\n- [x] writing_plan.yaml 审批通过\\\\n- [ ] Step 2: Plot Generation (Paper Agent 进行中)\\\\n- [ ] Step 3-5: Draft → Refinement → Submit to Review\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\n- **westb-23072**: 2× ~98GB GPU | 当前全部空闲 ⚠️\\\\n- **westd-11672**: 2× ~95GB GPU | 当前全部空闲 ⚠️\\\\n- 约束 C001: 仅允许 westb cuda:0/1, westd cuda:0/1\\\\n- 总预算 ~480 GPU-hours (10 days × 4 GPU × 24h)\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [ ] 确认 25% SFT eval 结果 → 更新 paper_framing.md\\\\n- [ ] 启动 25% GRPO (westb 2卡) — 预期 collapse 比 20% 更快\\\\n- [ ] Qwen2.5-Math-7B 剪枝完成 → SFT (westd 2卡)\\\\n- [ ] Paper Agent Step 2 完成 → 审查 plots\\\\n- [ ] 30% sparsity 如时间允许\\\\n\\\\n## 关键风险\\\\n1. **DDL 9天** — 25% GRPO + Qwen Math 需要并行推进，不能串行\\\\n2. **25% SFT gap** — 如果 25% 下 RASP vs Standard SFT gap 显著，加强 C3\\\\n3. **Qwen Math 可能不复现** — 但单模型+多sparsity已足够 EMNLP Findings\\\\n4. **Paper writing 与实验并行** — Paper Agent 先用 20% 数据写主体，后续 patch 25%/Qwen 数据\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D047 | 2026-05-16 | 新增 RASP-RLVR 实验：反转 CKA scoring 保护冗余结构，预防 GRPO coll | grpo_stage2_rasp_20_v9, grpo_stage2_standard_20_v8, grpo_unpruned_v2 |\\\\n| D046 | 2026-05-16 | Qwen Math calibration=256 不重跑，论文加 footnote 说明差异 | prune_rasp_20_qwen_math, prune_standard_20_qwen_math |\\\\n| D045 | 2026-05-16 | Core data complete: GRPO reward-accuracy decouplin | eval_grpo_unpruned_v2_step100, eval_grpo_rasp_v9_step5, grpo_unpruned_v2 |\\\\n| D044 | 2026-05-16 | Major narrative pivot: from \\\\\\\"RASP enables better R | eval_grpo_standard_step50_full, grpo_stage2_standard_20_v8, grpo_stage2_rasp_20_v9 |\\\\n| D043 | 2026-05-15 | Standard v8 step 60 确认 collapse。三模型全 collapse 时间线： | grpo_stage2_standard_20_v8, grpo_stage2_rasp_20_v8, grpo_unpruned_baseline, eval_sft_standard_full_westd, eval_sft_rasp_full_westd |\\\\n| D042 | 2026-05-15 | 暂不引用 GRPO collapse 因果结论——等 Standard v8 完成后对比三者 col | grpo_unpruned_baseline, grpo_stage2_rasp_20_v8, grpo_standard_v8 |\\\\n| D041 | 2026-05-15 | Unpruned baseline 实验设计无效——缺少 SFT 步骤，不构成公平对照 | grpo_unpruned_baseline |\\\\n| D040 | 2026-05-15 | Unpruned baseline 判定无效，需重新设计为 SFT→GRPO 流程 | grpo_unpruned_baseline |\\\\n| D039 | 2026-05-15 | Unpruned GRPO collapse invalidates \\\\\\\"pruning causes | grpo_unpruned_baseline, grpo_stage2_standard_20_v8, grpo_rasp_20_v8 |\\\\n| D038 | 2026-05-15 | Narrative pivot: 暂定 Narrative A (Pruning for Plast | grpo_rasp_20_v8, grpo_stage2_standard_20_v8, grpo_unpruned_baseline |\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 4449, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_019gBJmxYgZGGNCrMCzaXUAT","session_id":"9d5d0222-b1c1-4be8-b4de-29f6a4e65a4a","uuid":"4e1d2179-bfbd-419e-af39-8151b5d9f67d","timestamp":"2026-05-16T15:35:03.385Z"}
